        <h3 class="adt-h3 inline-block bg-amber-300 px-4 py-1 font-medium text-slate-900" data-id="pg033_n0005">Situata 2.</h3>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="adt-body mt-6 text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-800">
      <span data-id="pg033_n0007">N&#xeb; vitin 2020, nj&#xeb; virus i quajtur Korona u p&#xeb;rhap n&#xeb; shum&#xeb; vende t&#xeb; bot&#xeb;s dhe i frik&#xeb;soi t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg033_n0008">Gjat&#xeb; asaj kohe, njer&#xeb;zit u mbyll&#xeb;n n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pi p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mos u s&#xeb;mur&#xeb; - kjo u quajt karantin&#xeb;.</span>
      <span data-id="pg033_n0009">Por edhe pse ishin t&#xeb; ndar&#xeb;, shum&#xeb; njer&#xeb;z ndihmuan nj&#xeb;ri-tjetrin.</span>
      <span data-id="pg033_n0010">Ata treguan mir&#xeb;si dhe solidaritet, duke ndihmuar ata q&#xeb; kishin m&#xeb; shum&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;, si t&#xeb; moshuarit ose t&#xeb; s&#xeb;mur&#xeb;t.</span>
      <span data-id="pg033_n0011">Bota u bashkua p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; shp&#xeb;tuar jet&#xeb; dhe p&#xeb;r ta kaluar m&#xeb; leht&#xeb; k&#xeb;t&#xeb; koh&#xeb; t&#xeb; v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;.</span>
    </p>

