    <div class="mt-8">
      <p class="adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-800">
        <span data-id="pg033_n0013">Pun&#xeb; n&#xeb; grupe: Formohen tri grupe n&#xeb; klas&#xeb;, ku secili grup zgjedh nj&#xeb; aktivitet solidar.</span><br>
        <span data-id="pg033_n0014">Grupi 1: Grumbullimi i rrobave p&#xeb;r familjet q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span><br>
        <span data-id="pg033_n0015">Grupi 2: Grumbullimi i lodrave p&#xeb;r familjet q&#xeb; kan&#xeb; nevoj&#xeb;.</span><br>
        <span data-id="pg033_n0016">Grupi 3: Vizatimi i kartolinave me mesazhe pozitive p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; moshuarit.</span>
