    <div class="mt-6 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
      <p class="adt-body text-left italic leading-relaxed text-slate-800">
        <span data-id="pg033_n0027">Solidariteti do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndihmosh dhe t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rkrah&#xeb;sh t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t, sidomos kur ata jan&#xeb; n&#xeb; v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;si.</span>
        <span data-id="pg033_n0028">Kur jemi solidar&#xeb;, ne lidhemi me njer&#xeb;zit p&#xeb;rreth nesh dhe i kuptojm&#xeb; ndjenjat dhe nevojat e tyre.</span>
        <span data-id="pg033_n0029">Kjo na b&#xeb;n m&#xeb; t&#xeb; af&#xeb;rt dhe m&#xeb; t&#xeb; bashkuar si shoq&#xeb;ri dhe m&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndjesh&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r nevojat, t&#xeb; drejtat dhe v&#xeb;shtir&#xeb;sit&#xeb; e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;ve.</span>
        <span data-id="pg033_n0030">Solidariteti &#xeb;sht&#xeb; m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb; jetese, p&#xeb;r t&#x2019;u ofruar mb&#xeb;shtetje njer&#xeb;zve n&#xeb; &#xe7;astet e v&#xeb;shtira.</span>
        <span data-id="pg033_n0031">T&#xeb; tregosh solidaritet do t&#xeb; thot&#xeb; t&#xeb; veprosh n&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb; t&#xeb; nj&#xeb; personi apo grupi tjet&#xeb;r shoq&#xeb;ror.</span>
        <span data-id="pg033_n0032">Duke mbrojtur interesat e tyre, ne mbrojm&#xeb; interesat tan&#xeb;.</span>
